Package: snapshot-menu
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: SnapshOT categorized tool menu
 An XDG menu that groups SnapshOT tools by engagement phase (Discovery, Traffic
 Analysis, Protocol Tools, Firmware/Hardware, Wireless/SDR, Reporting), in the
 style of the Kali tools menu.
